//! Blind discovery against every catalogued BIN + XDF pair.
//!
//! ## Source
//!
//! `DAFTAR_PASANGAN_BIN_XDF_TERVERIFIKASI.md` records 647 firmware/definition
//! pairs whose ECU codes match. Every one was verified to exist on disk before
//! this suite was written.
//!
//! ## Method
//!
//! Each ROM is scanned **blind** — the scanner never reads the XDF. The XDF is
//! then the oracle: its declared table addresses are compared with what the
//! scanner reported, within a 16-byte window.
//!
//! Only XDFs that declare at least one multi-cell table are counted; a
//! definition of nothing but 1x1 scalars measures nothing.
//!
//! ## Integrity
//!
//! Every ROM is hashed before and after; the test fails if any changed.

